From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] irqchip: SSD20xD GPI, MSC313 PM and wakeup interrupt
 controllers

The SoC GPIO interrupt block (GPI), the PM interrupt controller behind the PM GPIOs and the PM wakeup
controller behind the SAR GPIOs.

Origin: https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux.git mstar_v6_5_rebase 5de660288cdf709dd40882bc57170f81ab744dea
  drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-intc.c
  drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-wakeup.c
  drivers/irqchip/irq-ssd20xd-gpi.c
Authors named by the carried files: Copyright (C) 2020 Daniel Palmer <daniel@thingy.jp>; Copyright (C) 2020 Daniel Palmer; Copyright (C) 2021 Daniel Palmer <daniel@thingy.jp>
License: GPL-2.0
---
 drivers/irqchip/Kconfig                |  19 +++
 drivers/irqchip/Makefile               |   2 +
 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-intc.c   | 135 ++++++++++++++++
 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-wakeup.c | 143 +++++++++++++++++
 drivers/irqchip/irq-ssd20xd-gpi.c      | 211 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 510 insertions(+)
